  "note": "enemy_residue_cantor (R8 Folding School, magic academy; craft labour / medium handler; cluster body, human scale, stateful split_merge, motion residue_lay). Author design: three choristers in dusky robes and pale ruffs pressed into one singing body, mouths open, thin fold-sheets in the outer hands, a shallow bronze basin of medium residue at their feet (support reference: the residue basin of FAM-ARPG-19 Grading Wall, same region). Telegraph (basin overflow): the middle cantor lifts the brimming basin overhead. Signature: the outer two split away while the basin is poured forward, residue running to a spreading pool. Break (medium residue): basin overturned, the three slumped in the spill. Phase 1 First Lay: sheets laid on the floor, one cantor stepped out drawing a dark gash with its hand. Phase 2 Contract Press: the trio squeezed together by contract straps, basin overflowing. Front battler, 60 deg view.",
